W:My old man said "Foller the van,
W:And don't dilly dally on the way".
W:Off went the van wiv me 'ome packed in it,
W:I followed on wiv me old cock linnet.
W:But I dillied and dallied, dallied and dillied
W:Lost me way and don't know where to roam.
W:Well you can't trust a Special like the old-time copper
W:When you can't find your way home.
