w:Grow-eth sed, and blow-eth mead, and spring'th the wu-de nu.
d3 B3|d3 z3|A2 F G2 E|F2 A G2 F|
w:Sing Cuc-cu! Aw-e blet-eth aft-er lombe, Lhouth
D2 F E2 C|D3 z3|F2 F E2 G|A2 A B2 c|
w:aft-er cal-ve cu; Bul-luc stert-eth, buck-e vert-eth
